  "sentences": [
    "Liu Wei worked in a factory that manufactured locks.",
    "Its old machine had a defect, and the payroll had not risen for two years.",
    "Every night he would indulge in short videos until two in the morning.",
    "He was addicted to his phone, and his mind wandered all day.",
    "He could not concentrate, and his wife would contradict him.",
    "He could not deny that she was right.",
    "His eyes hurt, and the doctor said the abuse of his sleep would affect his heart.",
    "The effect was easy to predict: he fell asleep at his desk and his pay slip indicated a fine.",
    "He showed less affection at home, and a habit like that can infect a whole family.",
    "A friend of his had gone through a divorce for the same reason.",
    "Then his wife became pregnant.",
    "One Monday he walked into the Riverside Community Centre.",
    "A receptionist asked him to register at the front desk.",
    "He wrote his name in the entry book, and she handed him a receipt.",
    "He was the first recipient of the new card.",
    "The card entitled him to three free cups of tea and a talk with a doctor.",
    "The centre was recruiting new members for the autumn term.",
    "The course quality was good and the fee was low.",
    "The facility had a quiet room and a long garden path.",
    "He paid for the first month and enrolled the same evening.",
    "On his first morning he took a stroll along the river and did not wander far from the centre.",
    "At ten a trolley came down the corridor with tea and biscuits.",
    "By the third week he could sit for an hour without his phone."
  ],
  "sentences_cn": [
    "刘伟在一家制造锁具的工厂上班。",
    "厂里那台老机器有个缺陷，工资单上的数字也两年没涨了。",
    "每天晚上，他都沉溺在短视频里，看到凌晨两点。",
    "他对手机上瘾，白天心思总是飘走。",
    "他集中不了精神，妻子为此常跟他抬杠。",
    "他没法否认她说得对。",
    "他的眼睛开始疼，医生说这样滥用睡眠会影响他的心脏。",
    "后果不难预言：他趴在桌上睡着了，工资条上写明了一笔罚款。",
    "他在家里表现出的感情越来越少，而这样的坏习惯会传染一整个家庭。",
    "他的一个朋友就是因为同样的原因离了婚。",
    "后来，妻子怀孕了。",
    "一个星期一，他走进了滨河社区中心。",
    "一位接待员请他在前台登记。",
    "他把名字写进登记簿，她递给他一张收据。",
    "他是新会员卡的第一位领取者。",
    "这张卡让他有权免费喝三杯茶，还能和医生谈一次。",
    "中心正在为秋季班招募新成员。",
    "课程质量不错，费用也低。",
    "这里的设施有一间安静的房间和一条长长的花园小径。",
    "他付了第一个月的钱，当天晚上就报了名。",
    "第一个早晨，他沿着河边散了会儿步，没走出中心太远。",
    "十点钟，一辆手推车沿着走廊推过来，上面是茶和饼干。",
    "到第三周，他已经能一个小时不碰手机了。"
  ],
